OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FBristol International Balloon Fiesta
OL,8,Ftakes off on Friday 7 August as
OL,9,Fvisitors and residents eagerly await
OL,10,Fthe spectacular event that sees
OL,11,Fballoons soar the skies.
OL,13,FThe free event runs from Friday 7 to
OL,14,FSunday 9 August at Ashton Court, with
OL,15,Fflights scheduled up to twice daily.
OL,17,FWeather-dependent mass ascents are
OL,18,Fscheduled at approximately 6am and 6pm
OL,19,Fon Friday and Saturday and well as
OL,20,FSunday morning.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
