OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FThe Fiesta attracts huge crowds to the
OL,8,Fcity and provides a busy schedule - so
OL,9,Fhere's a list of all you need to know.
OL,11,FHow do I get to the Bristol Balloon
OL,12,FFiesta?
OL,14,FAshton Court sits to the south-west of
OL,15,FBristol city centre and directions are
OL,16,Fsignposted from all routes into the
OL,17,FFiesta.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786126702
OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FFor those driving to the event, car
OL,8,Fparking tickets must be purchased in
OL,9,Fadvance. Several road closures and
OL,10,Fparking restriction zones are in place
OL,11,Faround Ashton Court estate.
OL,13,FIt's also worth keeping in mind that
OL,14,FBristol operates a Clean Air Zone,
OL,15,Fwhich may affect your journey and
OL,16,Fincur a charge.
OL,18,FTickets can also be bought for a
OL,19,Fshuttle bus from Bristol Temple Meads
OL,20,FStation and the City Centre to the
OL,21,Fevent.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
