CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786126702
OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FThe service is operated by StageCoach
OL,8,Fand runs from 10am on Friday, Saturday
OL,9,Fand Sunday, with return journeys
OL,10,Frunning until 11.30pm on Friday and
OL,11,FSaturday and 9.30pm on Sunday.
OL,13,FThe nearest train station to Ashton
OL,14,FCourt is Parson Street, which is a 30-
OL,15,Fminute walk from the site.
OL,17,FFor those looking to cycle or walk,
OL,18,Fthe Festival Way shared path leads to
OL,19,Fthe site.
OL,21,FWhat's on at the Balloon Fiesta?
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
