SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786126702
OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FWeather-dependent mass ascents are
OL,8,Fscheduled at approximately 6am and 6pm
OL,9,Fon Friday and Saturday as well as
OL,10,FSunday morning.
OL,12,FAfter dark on Friday and Saturday
OL,13,Fvisitors can stay to watch the 9pm
OL,14,FNightglows - during which dozens of
OL,15,Fballoons inflate to glow in time to
OL,16,Fmusic.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
