OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786126702
OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FThe main arena is also programmed
OL,8,Fthroughout the day with music and
OL,9,Fevents including Meet The Pilots,
OL,10,Finflation races and tethered hot air
OL,11,Fballoons, to stunt displays,
OL,12,Finteractive challenges and Samba bands.
OL,14,FThis year, the world's first ever
OL,15,Fcanopy shaped like a giant suitcase
OL,16,Fwill be on show and in the skies.
OL,17,FCameron Balloons have been working on
OL,18,Fthe secret assignment in the city for
OL,19,Fthe last few months.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
