CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786126702
OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FWhere are the best places to see the
OL,8,Fhot air balloons?
OL,10,FThe route the balloons will travel is
OL,11,Fdetermined by the wind direction but
OL,12,Fthey often head across the city.
OL,14,FFor those not planning to be on-site
OL,15,Fat Ashton Court, there are plenty of
OL,16,Flocations around the city that allow
OL,17,Ffor stunning views of the balloons in
OL,18,Fflight.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786126702
OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FLess than a 20-minute walk away from
OL,8,FAshton Court, Greville Smyth Park can
OL,9,Fbe a great spot to watch the balloons
OL,10,Fsetting off across the city.
OL,12,FVictoria Park is another nearby option
OL,13,Fto catch some views of the ascents.
OL,15,FOver towards Clifton, the Observatory,
OL,16,Fthe Suspension Bridge and the Downs
OL,17,Fare all popular areas for balloon-
OL,18,Fchasers.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786126702
OL,3,CAll you need to know for Balloon
OL,4,CFiesta - including city's best viewing
OL,5,Cspots
OL,7,FFor those looking to sit in bars and
OL,8,Frestaurants to watch the ascents,
OL,9,Fheading to the Harbourside will make
OL,10,Ffor a great evening.
OL,12,FGaining some height will allow for
OL,13,Fsome good views of the flights, so
OL,14,Fit's also worth climbing up Brandon
OL,15,FHill, Troopers Hill or Perretts Park.
OL,17,FIf you're willing to go out of the
OL,18,Fcity, Dundry Hill near Bristol Airport
OL,19,Fis a great location for peaceful views
OL,20,Fof the balloons.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
